<p class="-3 3 0 left 0 1" just="left">AN ACT TO AMEND AND EXTEND THE REDUNDANCY PAYMENTS ACTS, 1967 TO 1973, AND TO PROVIDE FOR OTHER CONNECTED MATTERS. [20<i>th March</i>, 1979]</p>
