<title>
<p fli="0" li="0" ri="0" just="left" before="0"><font size="small" smallcaps="no">Definitions.</font></p>
</title>
<number>1</number>
<p class="2 0 0 left 0 1" just="left"><b>1.</b><emdash/>In this Act<emdash/></p>
<p class="0 0 0 left 0 1" just="left"><odq/>the Act of 1971<cdq/> means the Redundancy Payments Act, 1971;</p>
<p class="0 0 0 left 0 1" just="left"><odq/>the Minister<cdq/> means the Minister for Labour;</p>
<p class="0 0 0 left 0 1" just="left"><odq/>the Principal Act<cdq/> means the Redundancy Payments Act, 1967.</p>
